.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
\fBCollapsible\fR: the disclosure primitive (Radix \fBCollapsible\fR). A header that is always shown and a body that slides open and closed (\fBreveal\fR, 250 ms). Controlled: the application owns \fBopen\fR, and the header carries the trigger.
.PP
\fBExpanderRow\fR is a collapsible with a row header; \fBAccordion\fR is several of them under a \fBSelection\fR.
